  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.1.0: Adds read-only FANUC alarm-history APIs. ReadAlarmHistoryAsync(index) reads one ALM[E{index}] entry through a 100-register, MULTIPLY=1 dynamic SETASG mapping. ReadAlarmHistoriesAsync(count) returns ordered entries from ALM[E1] and stops at the first empty entry. Alarm code, message, severity, timestamp, and optional cause data are decoded according to Additional-Option Manual section 55.3.6. Verified read-only on ROBOGUIDE.",
